        "Content": "Ref: 9181\n\nFour Bedroom Detached Residence With Adjoining Garage In An Excellent Location For Sale By Private Treaty\n\nLOCATION & DESCRIPTION: \nQUINN PROPERTY are delighted to introduced this spacious four bedroom detached bungalow to the market. Located just off Coolgreany`s main street, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers. Coolgreany is a well-established village, ideally positioned between Gorey and Arklow, with a thriving community and a rich heritage. All local amenities are within easy walking distance and include a pub, primary school and GAA grounds. The surrounding countryside offers an excellent choice of recreational and leisure pursuits, including beautiful woodland trails and walks at nearby Ballyfad Woods. Excellent road connectivity provides easy access to the M11, with South Dublin accessible in approximately one hour, making this an ideal location for those seeking the tranquility of village life while remaining within convenient commuting distance of Dublin.\n\nThis spacious property offers bright and welcoming living accommodation throughout and would be perfectly suited for family life or for those looking to downsize. Accommodation briefly comprises of a front porch, entrance hall, two spacious living rooms, a kitchen / dining room, a walk-in hotpress, a family bathroom, W.C and four well-proportioned bedrooms with one ensuite. The property also benefits from an adjoining garage and storage room. \n\nOUTSIDE:\nSituated on a slightly elevated site, this property enjoys a private and mature grounds that wraps around the residence. A tarmacadam driveway leads up to the property offering plenty of space for off-street parking. The gardens have been beautifully maintained and extend to C. 0.3 acres, a patio area to the rear of the residence offers an excellent space for outdoor dining and relaxing. The property benefits from mature boundaries offering a great deal of privacy and shelter while established shrubbery is incorporated throughout the garden.\n \nEntrance Hall:3.9m x 2.0mOak flooring, sliding door to front porch.\nSitting Room:3.6m x 4.8mOak flooring, fireplace with a Stanley stove, fitted units.\nKitchen / Dining Room:4.0m x 4.3mTiled flooring, tiled splashback, fitted units at waist and eye level, dishwasher, electric cooker, fridge, recessed lightening.\nRear Lobby:2.1m x 1.5mTiled flooring, shelving, back door to rear garden, walk-in shelved hotpress.\nLiving Room:3.6m x 4.6mCarpet flooring, fitted units, open fire with electric insert. \nBedroom 1:3.2m x 2.7mOak flooring, fitted wardrobe, ensuite.\nEnsuite:1.7m x 1.8mFully tiled, W.C., W.H.B., shower.\nBedroom 2:3.6m x 3.9mLaminate flooring, W.H.B.\nBedroom 3:3.2m x 2.8mCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobe. \nBedroom 4:3.0m x 2.6mCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobe,\nBathroom:3.0m x 1.7mFully tiled, shower, bath, W.C., W.H.B.\nW.C.:2.0m x 0.8mFully tiled, W.C., W.H.B.\nBoiler Room:2.1m x 1.7m\n\nSERVICES AND FEATURES:\nAll Mains Services\nOil Fired Central Heating\nProperty Extends To C. 159m2\nBuilt: 1974\nAttic With Stira Stairs\nAdjoining Garage Extending To C. 22m2\nStorage Room\n\nBER DETAILS:\nBER: E\nBER No. 119818854\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 303.41kWh/m²/yr\n\nBeautifully Presented Four Bedroom Detached Bungalow, Within Walking Distance Of Coolgreany Main Street\n\n\n \n\n\n"
